Compatibility of the Data Type string
The data type string only recognizes the addition operator (+). Plant Simulation combines the two strings
to a new string, meaning that it appends the second string to the first string.
Remarks
We type in this instruction:
print "My short string " + "plus my long string with many words."
The output in the Console looks like this:
As an exception you can also add an integer value to a string. Plant Simulation converts the integer value
to a string and appends it.
param obj : object -> string
return obj.Name + obj.Label + obj.XPos
